	(text "RADAR WARNING RECEIVER BRIGHTNESS ADJUST\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 291.211 125.095 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "7dd03e4b-a681-4dc4-b1af-b5df6a91e177")
	)
	(text "1) 	ARDUINO MEGA PROGRAMMING: REMOVE ARDUINO MEGA FROM\n    	STANDBY CONTROLLER PCB PRIOR TO PROGRAMMING MEGA VIA USB.\n\n2) 	RS485 BUS TERMINATION: DO NOT INSTALL J2 (BUS OUT) CONNECTOR \n    	AND ADD A 120OHM THRU-HOLE RESISTOR ACROSS PINS 4&5 OF J2 \n    	(BUS OUT) ON LAST ABSIS DEVICE ON THE RS485 BUS.\n\n3) 	BL DATA SELECT: PLACE A SOLDER BRIDGE ON (SB1) FOR EITHER OPERATING CONDITION\n		A) BACKLIGHT CONTROLLER INPUT - PINS 1 & 2\n		B) MCU CONTROL - PINS 2 & 3\n		WARNING - DO NOT SOLDER ALL THREE PINS TOGETHER, DAMAGE COULD OCCUR\n		IF SOLDER JUMPER IS MISSING, BACKLIGHT LEDS WITH  BE NON-FUNCTIONAL\n\n	INSTALL JUMPER CAPS ACROSS THE FOLLOWING PINS:\n	IF THE ASSOCIATED GAUGE IS NOT CONNECTED, WITHOUT THE JUMPER CAPS,\n	BACKLIGHT DATA WILL NOT BYPASS THE MISSING GAUGE CONNECTOR AND \n	ILLUMINATE THE LEDS ON THE STANDBY CLUSTER\n\n	THE PINS AT EACH LOCATION ARE NOTATED WITH AN ASTERISK (*)\n		ALTIMETER (J5) - 13&14\n		VVI (J7) - 9&10\n		AIRSPEED (J6) - 9&10\n	WARNING - DO NOT JUMPER ANY OTHER PINS OR DAMAGE COULD OCCUR\n\n4)	THIS IS A 4 LAYER BOARD\n		OUTER LAYERS ARE 1OZ COPPER\n		INNER LAYERS ARE 0.5OZ COPPER\n\n5)	THIS BOARD IS IMPEADANCE CONTROLLED\n		USE JLC04161H-7628 STACKUP\n\n6)	WARNING - INTERCONNECT HARNESS CONSTRUCTION\n		DEPENDING ON YOUR REVISION OF THE GAUGE PCBS CONSTRUCTED, NOT\n		ALL PINS ON THE GAUGE HEADERS WILL BE CONNECTED.  REFER TO THE GAUGE PCB\n		SCHEMATIC TO HELP CROSS REFERENCE WIRING.  PIN NAMES MAY NOT BE CONSISTANT\n		BETWEEN CONTROLLER AND GAUGE PCBS.\n		PAY CLOSE ATTENTION TO STEPPER MOTOR CONNECTIONS\n\n		PIN PAIRS ARE AS FOLLOWS:\n			COIL 1: A & B\n			COIL 2: C & D\n\n		CAUTION: DO NOT SWAP A PIN FROM COIL 1 & 2 TO THE OPPOSING COIL\n			UNPREDICATABLE RESULTS WILL OCCUR.\n		IT MAY BE NEEDED TO SWAP PINS WITHIN A COIL DEPENDING ON THE SPECIFIC WIRING\n		IMPLEMENTATION FOR PROPER STEPPER OPERATION"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.716 112.268 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8e6de523-44bd-4eb4-94bb-747439904536")
	)
